  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41123" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Industrial Development Organization</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Rwanda#s capacities to respond to industrial and natural hazards</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the increasing incidence of natural or man-made disasters in Rwanda, including those caused by climate change, the country needs to enhance its response capacities. Against this backdrop, the proposed project aims to improve the capacities of Rwanda#s fire fighting and emergency services by supporting fire stations in selected locations, in particular through training of relevant personnel, including volunteer fire fighters, and equipment provision. The project will also contribute to increasing public awareness on fire safety and increase basic fire fighting practices.</narrative>
  </description>
